# Stack: Rust gRPC

Package choices only. Trees and protobuf *placement* live in `rust-core` / `backend-rust-grpc-architecture-patterns` / `monorepo-architecture`. Attach with the Rust gRPC preset.

| Concern | Choice | Notes / fallback |
|---------|--------|------------------|
| gRPC | Tonic | Implement generated service traits in `endpoints.rs` |
| Protobuf | prost (+ tonic-build / buf codegen) | Shared gen package; do not hand-edit |
| Proto lint/generate | buf | Same workflow as other protobuf stacks |
| Async runtime | Tokio | |
| SQL | sqlx | When SQL is needed |
| Domain errors | thiserror | Map to `tonic::Status` at the endpoint |
| Binary-edge errors | anyhow | `main` edges only |
| Logging | tracing | |
| L2 tests | in-process Tonic server | Assert `Status` and contracts |
